---
description: pnpm lockfile and minimumReleaseAge — keep Vercel installs green
globs: package.json,pnpm-lock.yaml,pnpm-workspace.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---

# pnpm / Vercel installs

- This repo declares `minimumReleaseAge: 1440` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (strict).
- After dependency bumps, run `pnpm install` locally and commit the lockfile.
- If Vercel fails with `ERR_PNPM_MINIMUM_RELEASE_AGE_VIOLATION`, resolve an older version that passes the age gate — don't disable the policy casually.
- pnpm only — never commit `package-lock.json` or `yarn.lock`.
